@baseUrl = https://localhost:7049
# Caso esteja rodando no perfil HTTP sem SSL, altere para:
# @baseUrl = http://localhost:5077

### 1. Registrar um usuário de teste
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Usuário Teste",
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Fazer login (gera o cookie .AuthService.Session)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "teste@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Iniciar fluxo OAuth2 Authorization Code + PKCE (sem seguir o redirect 302 para localhost:3000)
# code_verifier correspondente ao code_challenge abaixo (RFC 7636):
# dBjftJeZ4CVP-mB92K27uhbUJU1p1r_wW1gFWFOEjXk
// @no-redirect
GET {{baseUrl}}/connect/authorize?client_id=web-client&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A3000%2Fcallback&response_type=code&scope=openid%20email%20profile%20offline_access&code_challenge=E9Melhoa2OwvFrKbTJguCHaoeK1t8URWbuGJSstw-cM&code_challenge_method=S256&state=xyz123
